  "description": "SHORT TERM LETTING 6 MONTHS\n\nBespoke Estate Agents are delighted to bring this recently refurbed two Bed, Two bath apartment to the market.\n\nThe accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway with built-in storage leading into a bright, open-plan living and dining area. This welcoming space is filled with natural light and opens onto a North west facing private balcony .\n A well-appointed kitchen is positioned just off the hall way  and features a full range of floor and overhead fitted units and built in appliances. Two  spacious double bedrooms, one of which is ensuite. The fully tiled main bathroom completes the accommodation. \n\nCowper Downs is a quiet, leafy cul-de-sac development, superbly positioned between the vibrant villages of Rathmines and Ranelagh, both of which are just a short stroll away. Residents enjoy an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, and boutiques, as well as top-class amenities and recreational facilities. The beautifully restored Stella Cinema is a favourite among film lovers, while Brookfield Tennis Club, Dartry Health Club, and Palmerston Park — with its open green spaces, playground, and pond — are all within easy walking distance.\n\n\n",
